# Normalise line endings in the repository, and in the working tree, to LF.
#
# Without this, a worktree created on Windows checks out CRLF while
# scripts/generate-pbxproj.mjs emits LF, so `project.pbxproj` differs from its own
# generator on every fresh clone. That produced a false "project file is out of date"
# failure in all five agent worktrees. Swift, JSON, YAML and Markdown have no reason to
# carry CRLF in a repository; the one place that cares is JavaScript on Windows, and
# node handles LF there without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.icns binary
*.xcassets/** binary
